# EL-JINDI Auto Services - Deployment Guide

**Deployment Target:** Render.com (Free Tier) + Render Managed PostgreSQL (Managed DB)  
**Cost:** $0 USD  
**Estimated Deployment Time:** 15-20 minutes  
**Status:** ✅ Ready for Production

